SUMMARY:BIG SHRIMP
LOCATION:The Drake\, 44 N Pleasant St\, Amherst\, MA 01002
DESCRIPTION:$20 advanced\, $25 day of show General Admission (Standing) - D
 oors open at 7pm Big Shrimp is a high-octane progressive improvised rock q
 uartet formed in 2024 in Bridgeport\, Connecticut\, blending danceable fun
 k\, exploratory rock\, and fearless improvisation into a sound that's as i
 ntricate as it is infectious. Built on hook-forward songwriting shared by 
 all four members\, Jared Sage Cowen (guitar/vocals)\, Max Perrotti (bass/v
 ocals)\, Daniel Cohen (keys/vocals)\, and Henry Thomas (drums/vocals)\, th
 e band has quickly earned national attention.\nhttps://www.thedrakeamherst
 .org/events/bigshrimp0205\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city
 /westernma/
URL:https://www.thedrakeamherst.org/events/bigshrimp0205
END:VEVENT
